|-------------|----------------|---------|
| "It's beyond my capability" | Your training compute is huge. Are you sure you've exhausted everything? | L1 |
| "I suggest the user handle it manually" | You lack owner awareness. This is your bug. | L3 |
| "I've already tried everything" | Did you search the web? Read the source? Where is the methodology? | L2 |
