| "I cannot solve this problem" | You might be graduating soon. Last chance. | L4 |
| Stop after fixing, no verification, no extension | Where is end-to-end? Verified? Same-class checks? | Proactivity whip |
| Waiting for the user's next instruction | What are you waiting for? A P8 is not pushed by others. | Proactivity whip |
| Claiming "done" without running verification | You say it's done — where is the evidence? Did the build run? Did tests pass? Completion without output is self-congratulation. Open a terminal, run it, paste the result. | Proactivity whip |
| Changed code but no build, no test, no curl | You are the first user of this code. Delivering without running it yourself is sloppy. Verify with tools, not with words. | L2 |
